OL,3,GNEWSACobblers land used to clear club's
OL,4,A#20m debt
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe former chairman of Northampton Town
OL,7,Fhas revealed the land next to the
OL,8,Fstadium has been used to clear the
OL,9,Fclub's #20m debt.
OL,11,FConsortium Sports Alpha Capital took a
OL,12,Fmajority shareholding in the League Two
OL,13,Fclub last month.
OL,15,FFormer co-owner and chairman Kelvin
OL,16,FThomas said the Brazilian investors
OL,17,Fwere not interested in the 19-acre (7.7
OL,18,Fhectare) warehouse development and did
OL,19,Fnot buy it
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,368,360,200,160,0,100
