OL,3,GNEWSACobblers land used to clear club's
OL,4,A#20m debt
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said the land was sold to a company
OL,7,Fcontrolled by the GRS Group - which
OL,8,Fconstructed the East Stand - in "a deal
OL,9,Fwhich meant the football club was debt
OL,10,Ffree".
